  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education Commission: Research to improve understanding of Delivery Approaches and Units in Education Reform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DeliverEd is responding to an evidence gap through primary research in four case study countries to investigate how national education priorities were delivered through the adaptation of Delivery Approaches, what were the characteristics of the approaches, how were they embedded in the government, and What outcomes were associated with them. The studies will also shed light on how outcomes changed before and after the approaches were taken and will look at what impacted the delivery approaches&#x2019; outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
